{"PANIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"OH GOD- oh god... GOD.. GOD .. GOOOOD!!!","NO- no.. NO .. NOOOOO!!!","It's got me, it's got me, somebody pull it OFF!","Let go! Let go of me, let GO!","Please, please, PLEASE, I'll do anything!","Help! HELP! I'm right here!","Not me, not ME!","I don't wanna die like this!","Mama! MAMA!","They're everywhere! They're EVERYWHERE!","I can't breathe- I can't- I CAN'T-","It won't let go, why won't it let go!","It's too strong, it's too strong, I can't-","Back- BACK- stay BACK!","No no no, not like this!","I don't wanna turn, please don't let me turn!","My hands, my hands won't- why won't my hands-","Shiiiit... shit... SHIT SHIT SHIT!!","AAAAHHHH- ah- ah- get AWAY!","Oh Jesus, Mary and Joseph, oh Jesus-","Make it go away!","Tommy! Tommy, help, TOMMY!","Daaaad!! DAD!!","I'm too young for this, I'm TOO YOUNG!","Wh- what do I do? What do I DO?!","My leg- my leg's stuck- it's STUCK-","Get it OFF!","Ahhh! Ahh! AHHHHH!","Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, JESUS!","Somebody HELP! Please! Anybody!","HEEEELP!!","Leave me alone! Leave me ALONE!","Please don't, please don't, PLEASE!","God, please, I'll go to church, I'll go every Sunday!","Dear God, dear God, dear God, dear-","Shut up, shut up, shut UP, I can't hear myself!","Nope! NOPE! Nopenopenope!","Mommy! Mommy, Mommy, MOMMY!","Why won't it stop?!","Whoa, whoa, whoa, WHOA, back off!","Mercy! Mercy! Have MERCY!","Aaaah! Ah, ah, nonono, GO AWAY!!","AAAAAHHHH!!! AAAAH!!","Run, run, run, I'm running, I AM running!","Oh no oh no oh no, the garage is open!","Is this my fault? Did I do this?","God, please, I'll quit drinking, I'll quit tomorrow, I'll quit RIGHT NOW!","Hhhhh... hhhh... can't... can't...","My glasses! I lost my glasses! I can't SEE!","Don't, don't, I'm NOT one of them!","Dale! Dale, answer me! DALE!","Aunt Rose! No no no, Aunt Rose!","Nonono, wait, that's my arm, let go of my ARM!","Ohhhh no, ohhh no, ohhhh no, ohhh NO","Wait, I know you, we went to school together, don't, DON'T!","Shoo! Shoo! Go on, git! GIT!","Stop yelling, you're making them come!","Help! Help me! Helllp meeee!","Not the kids! Take me, leave the kids!","No! No! Nooo! Nooooo!!","Run! Run, Ellie, run, run, RUN!","Mmmph- mmm- nnnngh- GET OFF!","Hold on, hold on, I'm coming, I'm COMING, don't go!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Get away from me, get AWAY, I'm warning you!","It's right on top of me, it's right on top of me!","Oh God, it's so close, it's so close, I can smell it","I'm cornered, there's nowhere to- there's nowhere!","Please don't leave me, please, I'm begging you!","I'm all alone, I'm all by myself, where did everybody go?!","Hhhh- hhh- I can't- I can't catch my breath-","Wait, WAIT, don't go, don't leave me, wait!","I'm not ready, please, give me a minute!","Oh no, they're all around us!","This can't be happening!","Go away, GO AWAY!","Somebody shut it up, shut it UP!","Stop, stop, stop, please stop!","Why me? Why ME?!","Run! Run! Why aren't I running?!","Where's the door? Where's the DOOR, I can't find it!","Please, please, I have kids, please!","I'll be good, I'll be so good, please","Oh God, I can't see, I can't see anything!","I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to-","It's looking at me! It's looking right at me!","They found us!","No, wait, wait, I know you, I KNOW you!","I can't do this, not anymore, I'm done!","Where do I go? There's no- where do I GO?","I can't feel my legs, why can't I feel my legs!","Oh, no no no, there's more, there's MORE!","It's coming, it's coming, it's COMING!","I knew it, I knew we shouldn't have stopped!","Run, run, RUN, why aren't you running?!","Wait for me, don't go without me!","Nobody told me, nobody ever told me it would be like this!","I want to go HOME, I want my own bed!","I'm gonna throw up, I'm gonna- oh God-","I can't think, somebody tell me what to do!","Backing up, I'm backing up, I'm backing up, I'm-","Is this it? Is this how it ends? In a PARKING LOT?","It's got my coat, it's got my COAT, I'm taking it off!","Stay back or- or- I don't know, just stay BACK!","Pull me up! Pull me UP!","I can hear them, I can hear them behind me!","Please, I'll give you anything, I'll give you my keys!","Nononono, I'm not doing this, I'm out!","Come back, don't leave me!","Oh no, there's another one!","I can't, I just can't, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry...","This is a nightmare, wake up, wake up!","Please let somebody come, please, please, please...","Oh God, they're so CLOSE, I thought I had more time!","What was that? Don't leave me here!","I can't run any more, I can't, my side!","Hold on to me, don't let go of me, don't!","No, no, no, not here, we were so close!","Get me out of this sweater, I can't breathe in it!","I'm gonna be strong, I'm gonna be- I'm crying","Not today, not now, I've got a baby coming in three weeks!","My shoe! It took my shoe! Leave the shoe, run!","Is there a God? Is anyone up there?","I only wanted to see my sister, that's all I wanted","It's just smoke, it's just smoke, why can't I see the sun?","I don't know how to do this, nobody showed me!","Please let it be over, let it be a bad dream, let me wake up...","I'm going to be sick- sorry- I'm going to be-","I can't, I just can't, tell my mother I tried!","Backing up, backing up, backing into something, oh God!","It's not fair, we didn't do anything, we didn't DO anything!","I thought you were my friend, I thought you were-","It's so loud in my head, I can't hear anything but my own heart","Oh, Jesus, Jesus, forgive me, forgive me for everything...","Don't look at me, don't look at me, please","I've got to get home, I've got to get home, they'll be worried","Please let somebody be alive, please, anybody, anybody alive?","Where's my purse? Where's my- forget the purse, GO!","Oh Lord, I can't go on, I can't go on one more step!","The phone's dead, I can't call anyone!"}},
{"PANIC","role=family_man|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Get away from my family!","Not my kids, you're not touching my kids!","Janet, run, take the girls - RUN!","Dammit, dammit, dammit, I told them we should've left!"}},
{"PANIC","role=family_man|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Stay behind me, BEHIND me!","I've got a mortgage, I've got two little girls!","Carrie, hold on to my shoulder, don't let go!"}},
{"PANIC","role=family_woman|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Not my baby! Not my BABY!","Tom! Tom, help me! TOM!","Take the children! Somebody take the children!","Don't touch her! Don't you TOUCH her!"}},
{"PANIC","role=family_woman|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Run, sweetheart, run, don't look back, Mommy's right behind you!","Oh God, where's Katie?!","My shift starts at six, I can't be late, I can't- oh God!"}},
