{"PANIC","role=family_elder|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I'm too old for this, go on without me, go on!","My legs, my old legs, they won't carry me!","Y'all run, I'll hold them off, I'm eighty years old, what do I care!","Where's my pills? Oh Lord, my heart!"}},
{"PANIC","role=family_youth|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Mom! MOM!","Holy- holy shit, HOLY SHIT!","Dude, help, HELP!","Get it away, get it AWAY from me!"}},
