{"PANIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Hold the line! Hold it! I can't hold it!","One at a time! One at a time, please, one at a time!","Over here, over here, I need a hand, over HERE!","Down, down, I'm down, help me up!","Please, I'm still me, look at me, I'm not one of them!","Not today, please, not today","I can't get my arm free, I can't get my arm out!","Where's the nearest- where's anywhere? Where's ANYWHERE?","They're closing in, we're not gonna make it, we're not!","Careful, careful, stay close, they're too close!","I can hear my own heartbeat, I can hear it in my ears!","Stay with me! Don't you give up on me!","I don't know how to fight, I never learned how to fight!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4",{"Damn it, I've got no room to move, I've got no room!","Hang on, I'm coming, hang ON!","Find a way out, there's got to be a gap somewhere"}},
