{"PANIC","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"I can't do this! I can't THINK!","10-33, 10-33, officer needs assistance!","I need backup NOW!","Get BACK, get back from me!","Fall back, fall BACK, everybody fall back!","Dispatch, I'm cut off, I'm cut off, say again, CUT OFF!","Oh God, they're on my left, on my LEFT!","Move! MOVE! Everybody out!","Stay with me, don't leave me out here!","Back! Get BACK! Stay away from me!","Cover me, I'm going, COVER ME!","Run! Everybody run! Go go go, GO!","Backup! BACKUP! Unit 9 to anyone, anyone!","My radio's dead, my radio's DEAD!","They're through the line, they're through the line!","Keep them off me, off, OFF!","There's too many for us, FALL BACK!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I can't hold them, I can't!","Where's my partner? Where's my backup? WHERE?!","Pruitt! Mullins! Anyone! Someone say something!","I'm out of room, I've got nowhere left to go!","Dispatch, are you there? Dispatch? DISPATCH!","I can't believe this is happening, I can't believe it!","Hey! HEY! Over here! I need help over here!","They don't stop, they don't STOP, why don't they stop!","Radio, radio, somebody get on the radio!","I can't raise anybody, no one on any channel!","Get the civilians out first, I'll hold, GO!","I'm out of ammo, I'm out, I've got nothing left!","Don't leave me, partner, don't leave me!","Where's the chief? Where's anyone who's in charge?","Someone say something, please say something on the radio"}},
{"PANIC","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=angry",{"Where's the Guard? Where's the DAMN Guard?!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Thirteen years on the job and this is how-","Easy, easy, I've got it, I've- no, I don't, I don't!","I always knew the badge wouldn't help, I just never thought it'd be today"}},
{"PANIC","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Fall back to the station! Fall back, fall back!","Take the civilians, I'll cover, GO!","To me, to ME, everybody to me!"}},
