{"PANIC","reg=military,elite|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Trouble! Overrun! I say again, OVERRUN!","Mayday, mayday, mayday!","Fall back, fall back!","Sergeant! SERGEANT! They're through!","Cover me, I have to move, I HAVE to move!","Get off me! Get OFF!","I can't hold this, there's too many of them!","Lieutenant! Lieutenant, they're inside the wire!","Request evac, request evac, request ANYTHING!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=military,elite|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I'm cut off from the squad! I'm cut off!","Request immediate assistance, request IMMEDIATE!","Radio, I need the radio, I need the radio NOW!","They're too close, I can't get distance!","I need a medic- no, I'm okay, I'm okay, forget it...","Sarge, they're not stopping!","I'm being overrun, I say again, overrun, overrun!","Command, Command, this is Kilo-Six, come in, COME IN!"}},
