{"PANIC","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Tommy! TOMMY! Don't you dare leave me!","Hey, hey, whoa, I'm alive, I'm still alive, look!","Get 'em off me, get 'em off, I'll go straight, I'll go STRAIGHT!","Pull the car around- there's no car! THERE'S NO CAR!","Hey! HEY! Look at me! Look at ME, not them!","Fuck, fuck, FUCK!","Get the fuck off me!","Get away from me!","I'm out, I'm so fucking out!","Back off! Back the fuck OFF!","Move! MOVE! Get out of my way!","Boss! BOSS! Where the hell are you?!","NOOOO- no- NO!","They're coming from every side, EVERY side!","Help! HELP! HEELP!","Ahhh! Ahhh! Get it off, GET IT OFF!","Is this a bad dream? Slap me, slap me, SLAP me!","Oh God, I'll do better, I promise!","AAAGGHH! AAGH!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I've got a kid in Louisville, I've got a kid!","Take the money, take it, just GO, leave me alone!","Somebody say a prayer, I don't know any!","I never hurt anybody, not really!","Oh Jesus, I'm sorry for all of it!","I got a mama in Rineyville, someone tell her-","I'd rather be back in county than this!","What do you want? What do you WANT from me?","I'm too young to go like this, I'm twenty-three!","I'm going, I'm going, I'm going, I'm going!","This is hell, this is actual hell, I'm in hell","Please, mister, please, I'll do anything you say!","Who's got my back? Who's got my BACK?","I ain't dying like this, not like THIS!","Help me! Anybody! I'll give you anything!","Don't leave me, man!","Oh no, oh shit, oh SHIT!","Where do I go? Where the fuck do I GO?","I can't get out, I can't get out, I'm stuck!","Mama! Fuck, Mama, I want my Mama!","What the hell, what the hell is this?!","Hey, hey, hey, easy, easy, I've got money!","I'm NOT ready, not like this!","Hold on, wait, wait for me!","I ain't going out like this, I ain't!","This ain't fair, I didn't DO anything!","I knew it, I knew this was a bad idea, I knew it!","Tell my brother I- tell him I- oh, forget it, RUN!","Where's my piece? Where's my- I don't have my piece!","Get behind me! Get behind- no, get in FRONT of me!","Stay away, I got a family, I got a daughter!","Cut it out, it hurts, it HURTS!","The hell with this, the hell with ALL of this!","Wait, wait, don't- hold on!","I can't breathe, can't breathe, somebody-","Quit it, I said quit, please!","Whoa, whoa, whoa, easy, easy, I'm a friend!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,4|mood=angry",{"Stupid, stupid, I was so stupid to come out here!","Run, you stupid sons of bitches, RUN!","Goddamn it, GODDAMN it!","Come on, move your fat ass!","I'm too goddamn old for this, too goddamn old!","I ain't gonna die in this shithole county!"}},
{"PANIC","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,2|mood=angry",{"Shit, I can't get clear!","Don't you touch me, you son of a BITCH!"}},
