{"PANIC","role=raider,raider_boss|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"We gotta go, we gotta go, we gotta go, NOW!","Cover me! Somebody cover me!"}},
{"PANIC","role=raider,raider_boss|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Boss, we're losing the left, we're losing the left!","I think I'm hit- no, I'm okay, I'm okay!"}},
{"PANIC","role=gang_member,gang_boss|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Nah nah nah, this ain't what I signed up for, this ain't it!","Nah, nah, I'm good, I'm good, don't touch me!","I'm too young to die, I'm too young!"}},
